WEBVTT

00:02:57.440 --> 00:03:01.736
i želim ti odgovoriti što je prije moguće,

00:03:01.760 --> 00:03:03.816
želim da znaš da sam tu za tebe.

00:03:03.840 --> 00:03:05.136
JF: Koristiš li emotikone?

00:03:05.160 --> 00:03:07.056
LT: Oh...
JF: Ne?

00:03:07.080 --> 00:03:09.150
LT: Sram me je.
JF: Ja baš volim emotikone.

00:03:09.150 --> 00:03:10.976
LT: Ne, ja ispisujem...

00:03:11.000 --> 00:03:15.776
Ispisujem svoje izraze sreće, čestitke

00:03:15.800 --> 00:03:17.456
i tugu.

00:03:17.480 --> 00:03:18.630
JF: Ispisuješ sve --

00:03:18.630 --> 00:03:20.301
LT: Ispisujem svako slovo.

00:03:20.325 --> 00:03:21.896
(Smijeh)

00:03:21.920 --> 00:03:23.096
JF: Kakva puritanka.

00:03:23.120 --> 00:03:25.056
Znate, kako starim,

00:03:25.080 --> 00:03:28.296
sve više razumijem značaj prijateljstva

00:03:28.320 --> 00:03:30.176
i zato se zaista trudim